          "text": "**Managing bash tool usage**\n\nThe bash tool is available, and I need to be cautious not to break permission settings. First, I'll start with a preToolPreamble for writing the document. I must be careful about shell injection when using heredoc to write content. After generating the file, I'll compare it with the existing version. If they're identical, I'll call noop; if different, I'll create a pull request with the appropriate steps. I'll also handle branch creation and ensure the branch name reflects the UTC date.",
